  "music": "w2-sizzle-street",
  "authorNotes": "Solo. Wide, generous counters (900px each) and two short 250px swing gaps, well inside the solo budget — nothing here should feel like a real test after 04. The mid counter's centre (1450-1750) is a grease patch (material grease) laid flush into the surface — a ketchup spill you slide across rather than fight, low-stakes fun since the counter is otherwise solid on both sides of it. All three objectives fit one relaxed pass: grab camera-5 and relic-w2-05-a on the starting counter, relic-w2-05-b right where the grease patch ends, and snap the photo (allSeatsInFrame + allAirborne) mid-arc on either swing. No checkpoint — the whole level stays under the no-checkpoint cap, and a death is a quick, easy replay."
